{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1560494-general-m20-homebrew-sharing-post","id":1560494,"title":"General M20 homebrew sharing post","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2026-06-09T14:30:33-07:00","id":1560494,"title":"General M20 homebrew sharing post","content":"I\u2019m creating this post as somewhere for everyone to share their MtAS 20th Edition homebrew content, may that be Paradigms, Practices, factions and so on.<br /> <br /> To start, here is a homebrew Practice I\u2019ve made:<br /> <br /> <b>NEW PRACTICE: GEOMANCY</b><br /> <br /> While often conflated in modern pop-culture with \u201cgeo<i>kinesis</i>\u201d, as in the ability to control the earth element (see the practice <b>Elementalism</b> in <b>The Book of Secrets</b>, pp. 200-201, and the subsection <i><b>Elemental Kinetics</b></i> in <b>How Do You DO That?</b> pp. 28-29), the term \u201cgeomancy\u201d, from the Late Greek <i>*ge\u014dmante\u00eda</i> literally \u201cearth divination\u201d, originally only referred to just that: fortune-telling via perceived signs in geographic features and/or in sets of sticks, dice or other such tokens cast in random patterns on the ground, all typically interpreted using complex systems of numerological symbology, sacred geometry and astrological correspondences. Beyond this strict classic definition, geomancy also more generally encompasses a host of disciplines, systems and beliefs that endeavor to identify the subtle energies and forces immanent in one\u2019s surroundings, natural or otherwise, in order to gain insight into they influence the world and \u2013 in the hands of a sufficiently proficient Awakened practitioner \u2013 find ways to bend and redirect this influence.<br /> <br /> Arabic <i>\u201bilm al-raml</i>, Malagasy <i>sikidy</i>, Yoruba <i>If\u00e1</i>, Chinese <i>feng shui</i> and <i>I Ching</i> divination, meditation or rituals within and around religious structures and sacred natural sites\u2026 all various manners, among others, by which an Awakened mystic may attune to location-based power, often as a component of other Practices, most notably including (but not limited to) <i>high ritual magick</i>, <i>elementalism</i>, <i>faith</i>, <i>witchcraft</i>, <i>shamanism</i>, <i>Voudoun</i>, <i>yoga</i> and <i>q\u00ec manipulation</i>. The importance of mathematics, geometry, physical landscape, structure design and management of space in the more elaborate and systemized forms of geomancy means that there\u2019s also room for it to be treated as an Enlightened technological discipline. Specifically, one revolving around obtaining useful information from your environment and giving yourself the means to leverage its properties according to your needs \u2013 the original Arabic term for geomancy, <i>\u201bilm al-raml</i>, literally means \u201cscience of the sand\u201d, after all. Thus, the Hindu architect designing buildings according to the traditional principles of <i>Vastu shastra</i> (<i>craftwork</i>), the Etherite tapping into the Etheric energies of ley lines and pyramid power (<i>weird science</i>), the Virtual Adept, Syndicalist or NWO agent arranging a room in a way mathematically optimized for functional efficiency or for inducing certain states of mind in themselves and other people (<i>Art of Desire, dominion or reality hacking</i>), and the Progenitor or Void Engineer using fine-tuned measurement tools and techniques to collect data from geography or the Earth\u2019s natural geomagnetic and geoelectric currents (<i>hypertech</i>) may all be considered practitioners of technomagickal geomancy. Whether you see it as Magick or Science, the basic premise remains the same: gaining insight from the world around you and leveraging its inherent power\u2026 a power which has an undeniably objective reality in the <i>World of Darkness</i> through the existence of Nodes, and if you want to get technical, all Awakened and Enlightened, regardless of Paradigms, Practices or Instruments, already perform an act of geomancy every time they refuel their personal Quintessence from a Node.<br /> <br /> The big problem of geomancy, of course, is that it\u2019s based more on reactive intel gathering and adaptation and subtle <i>coincidental</i> influence than direct action and overt <i>vulgar</i> Reality-warping, and unless combined with another Practice, the power by definition does not come from you and is highly contextually dependent on locational factors. Progress towards Ascension will eventually allow you to realize how to impose your Will upon the world\u2019s flow, but in the meantime, you\u2019ll have to make do with finding ways to navigate the flow and nudge it towards desired results. Geomancy as a Practice, at its most basic level, enables you to use fortune-telling to measure whether certain things, environmental factors or courses of action are auspicious or inauspicious for you and others, often involving the Entropy Sphere, along with other basic acts of supernatural perception and prediction. With a bit of expertise and the right Spheres, you may become able to more or less subtly influence good and bad luck, the weather, ambient flows of Quintessence and the vitality and mental states of living beings, along with placing or removing spiritual wards and seals upon locations \u2013 all things which, of course, may be applied to deliberately harmful results, especially in the case of Nephandi geomancers.<br /> <br /> <b>Associated Paradigms:</b> <i>A Mechanistic Cosmos</i>, <i>All Power Comes from God(s)</i>, <i>Ancient Wisdom is the Key</i>, <i>Creation\u2019s Divine and Alive</i>, <i>Divine Order and Earthly Chaos</i>, <i>Everything is Chaos</i>, <i>Everything is Data</i>, <i>Everything\u2019s an Illusion</i>, <i>Existence is Unknowable, Irrational and Sublime</i>, <i>Forbidden Wisdom is the Truest Source of Power</i>, <i>Holographic Reality</i>, <i>It\u2019s All Good \u2013 Have Faith!</i>, <i>Tech Holds All Answers</i>, <i>Turning the Keys of Reality</i>, <i>We are Meant to be Wild</i><br /> <br /> <b>Associated Abilities:</b> Academics, Area Knowledge, Awareness, Belief Systems, Esoterica (Astrology, Feng Shui, Fortune-Telling, Ley Lines, Sacral Architecture, Sacred Geometry), High Ritual, Meditation, Science (Astronomy, Geography, Geology, Hypermathematics), Survival<br /> <br /> <b>Associated Instruments:</b> Blessings and curses, cards and instruments of chance, celestial alignments (as geomancy often goes hand in hand with astrology), circles and designs, crossroads, devices and machines, elements, energy, formulae and math, gadgets and inventions, gems and stones, group rites (within places of power), herbs and plants, household tools and furniture, knots and ropes (wrapped around a location or natural feature of particular potency, such as in the example of <i>shimenawa</i> ropes in Shinto), meditation, numbers and numerology, q\u00ec tools (lu\u00f3p\u0103n), sacred iconography (religiously-significant natural features and dedicated sacred structures)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28221-chronorebel","name":"ChronoRebel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}